import{_ as i,o as t,c as o,a2 as s}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 319 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Cosmic Battlefield: Zero-Sum Game of Civilizational Resources","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 319 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Cosmic Battlefield: Zero-Sum Game of Civilizational Resources","no":319,"module":2,"tags":["Shrouding the Heavens","Cosmic Battlefield","Zero-Sum Game","Civilizational Resources","Cross-Star-Region War"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","15-Energy Circulation and Transformation Law","18-Cultivation Resource Opening Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0319_模块2-遮天-宇宙战场.md","filePath":"en/0319_模块2-遮天-宇宙战场.md"}'),n={name:"en/0319_模块2-遮天-宇宙战场.md"};function a(r,e,l,c,d,u){return t(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[s('<h1 id="entry-319-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-cosmic-battlefield-zero-sum-game-of-civilizational-resources" tabindex="-1">Entry 319 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Cosmic Battlefield: Zero-Sum Game of Civilizational Resources <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-319-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-cosmic-battlefield-zero-sum-game-of-civilizational-resources" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 319 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Cosmic Battlefield: Zero-Sum Game of Civilizational Resources&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Shrouding-the-Heavens System (Entry 32) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 15, 18</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-the-cosmos-itself-is-designed-as-one-big-battlefield" tabindex="-1">Introduction: When the cosmos itself is designed as one big battlefield <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-the-cosmos-itself-is-designed-as-one-big-battlefield" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: When the cosmos itself is designed as one big battlefield&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the anti-predation axiom opposes zero-sum predation; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires Myriad Ranks to symbiose, not mutually annihilate. This entry dissects Shrouding-the-Heavens world&#39;s &quot;cosmic battlefield&quot; setting — star regions are designed as mutually resources, mutually battlefields in a zero-sum pattern; between civilizations only life-and-death. The law-first axiom requires: treating the cosmos as a casino is not an axiom, but old Heavenly Dao. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = medium (oligarchic civilization). The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cosmic battlefield&#39;s energy waste:</p><ul><li>Wars between star regions consume cosmos-tier energy; energy civilization could have used for construction all goes to mutual destruction</li><li>Defeated star regions&#39; cultivators, knowledge, resources taken in by winners; the defeated side&#39;s civilization accumulation zeroed</li><li>Long-term war makes all civilizations place strongest ones in military rather than construction posts</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Zero-sum battlefield&#39;s regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Civilization = enemy state</strong>: star regions default hostile; cooperation impossible</li><li><strong>Spoils logic</strong>: one civilization&#39;s strength necessarily at another&#39;s decline</li><li><strong>Arms race</strong>: all civilizations forced to prioritize military development; livelihood and knowledge investment compressed</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ye Fan&#39;s role in the cosmic battlefield is the amplified version of predatory thinking:</p><ul><li><strong>Cross-star-region plunder</strong>: resources Ye Fan&#39;s side &quot;takes&quot; on the cosmic battlefield all come from defeated star regions</li><li><strong>Inter-civilizational zero-sum</strong>: Ye Fan faction&#39;s strength rests on other star regions&#39; failure</li><li><strong>War = justice</strong>: guarding humanity&#39;s star region is endowed with moral legitimacy, but never reflects on &quot;why must we fight&quot;</li></ul><p>The cosmic battlefield also has an ecological consequence: it makes long-term trust between star regions impossible. Today&#39;s ally may be tomorrow&#39;s enemy, because resources are limited and war can restart anytime. Under this structure, any cross-star-region knowledge cooperation is impossible — you dare not teach cultivation methods to a star region that may come attack you tomorrow. So cosmic civilization as a whole is in a state of &quot;each groping, no exchange&quot;; wisdom that could have been shared is locked in closed star regions. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s cross-plane anchor connection precisely breaks this distrust — when star regions are not battlefields but partners, knowledge can flow at cosmic scale.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Shrouding Cosmic-Battlefield Zero-Sum</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Star regions mutually battlefields</td><td>Cross-plane anchor connection, star regions mutually partners</td></tr><tr><td>Defeated star regions zeroed</td><td>Myriad Races republicanism, the defeated are also co-governance members</td></tr><tr><td>War consumes energy</td><td>Civilization energy all used for construction</td></tr><tr><td>Arms race</td><td>20% Activation Strategy used for ascension</td></tr><tr><td>Inter-civilizational zero-sum</td><td>Develop increment Origin, enlarge the cake</td></tr><tr><td>Cosmos is a casino</td><td>Cosmos is a co-construction work site</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Shrouding star-region war network</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: inject &quot;cross-star-region anchor connection + increment development&quot; vs. &quot;maintain zero-sum battlefield&quot;</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: war frequency, civilization total energy, defeated-civilization survival rate</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: conclusion — under zero-sum battlefield all civilizations internal-friction in arms race; under symbiotic plan civilization total energy continuously rises</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency</strong>: medium-low — star-region strength adjusts by plot need</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk</strong>: medium — battlefield scale serves Ye Fan&#39;s fight scenes</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: medium — Ye Fan faction wins the zero-sum battlefield</li></ul><p>The cosmic battlefield also makes &quot;diplomacy&quot; impossible. Under zero-sum pattern, between star regions there are only two relationships: enemy state and conquered enemy state. No neutrality, no cooperation, no trade. Under this structure, cosmic civilization&#39;s total wisdom is forever dispersed across hostile star regions, unable to converge. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s cross-plane anchor connection precisely changes the cosmos from battlefield to network — star regions exchange knowledge, coordinate resources through anchor connections, not through war to fight over resources.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: war internal friction, civilization zeroing, arms race</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: cross-star-region plunder is cosmos-tier predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo war limited to internal humanity; Shrouding upgrades war to cosmic scale</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: on the battlefield, defeated star regions&#39; Myriad-Rank beings are slaughtered or taken in</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: zero-sum battlefield cannot symbiose with cross-multiverse civilizations</li></ul><p>The cosmic battlefield also makes &quot;pacifism&quot; impossible. Under zero-sum pattern, the side advocating peace is eliminated by the war side, so pacifists cannot survive. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s cross-plane anchor connection precisely gives pacifists living space — not by personal goodwill, but by institutional protection.</p><ul><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Designing the cosmos as a battlefield is equivalent to announcing at cosmic scale &quot;cooperation is impossible.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer: the cosmos is not a battlefield, but a work site — all civilizations co-build on this site, not mutually demolish.</p><p>The cosmic battlefield also makes &quot;civilizational exchange&quot; taboo. Star regions dare not exchange goods and knowledge, because knowledge may be used by the enemy. This closedness makes each star region reinvents the wheel; civilization as a whole advances slowly. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s cross-plane connection precisely makes knowledge flow replace resource contest.</p><p>In the final analysis, Shrouding-the-Heavens · cosmic battlefield described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./318_模块2-遮天-成仙路设定.html">Entry 318 · Immortalization Road</a> · <a href="./302_模块2-遮天-人族本位批判.html">Entry 302 · Human-Centered Critique</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const g=i(n,[["render",a]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
